Begin3
Title:          File Slicer
Description:    A simple archive and file slicing/spanning utility for DOS. (UPX Compressed)
Summary:        A simple archive utility (not a file compression program) to categorize and split large files and directories across smaller medium. It requires an 8086 with EGA or better graphics. (UPX Compressed)
Keywords:       dos 16 bit file archive span split slice
End
